    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{II} Æt ærestan we lærað, þæt mæst ðearf ís, þæt æghwelce mon his að ⁊ his wed wærlice healde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">First we instruct, that it is most needful, that each man should prudently keep his oath and his vow.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">In the first place we enjoin you, as a matter of supreme importance, that every man shall abide carefully by his oath and his pledge.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">II. Æt ærestan we lærað, ðæt mæst þearf is, þæt æghwilc man his að ⁊ his wedd wærlice healde.</ab>
      </div>
